    "title": "My Memorial Hermann\u2122",
    "description": "My Memorial Hermann\u2122 and MyChart allow you to: \r\n\u2022 Schedule in-person or virtual care, including same day or next day \r\n\u2022 View medical records and results  \r\n\u2022 Complete patient forms before your appointment \r\n\u2022 Send secure messages to your care team\r\n\u2022 Review medications, immunizations and visit notes\r\n\u2022 Notify your provider when you\u2019ve arrived  \r\n\u2022 Receive personalized support for your unique health journey\r\n\r\nAt Memorial Hermann, your care is our priority. Our network of quality physicians, hospitals and specialty facilities serve the greater Houston area with expertise curated for your needs.",
